#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1043 expect=skipped domain=LB
#note "LBTEST is not in the dataset (rule round 2026-10-12, var_exists sweep, owner 2026-10-07): the grouping key --TEST moved from a Check-level var_exists guard into Requirements.Variables.All, so the rule is SKIPPED instead of passing silently. Red under the old rule (it ran: no violation). Without either gate the absent key drops out of the grouping, and the two different values below would be judged inconsistent across the whole dataset."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset LB class=FINDINGS label="Laboratory Test Results"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col LBSEQ type=Num label="Sequence Number"
col LBTESTCD type=Char label="Lab Test or Examination Short Name"
---
S1 | LB | 001 | 1 | ALB
S1 | LB | 001 | 2 | GLUC
